      "statement": "Migration workflow uses Nx commands: `nx run <project>:migration:run` applies pending migrations, `nx run <project>:migration:generate` creates a migration from entity changes and extracts SQL for linting, `migration:revert`, `migration:show`, `migration:extract-sql-latest`, and `migration:extract-sql-all` are also available.",
