      "statement": "Import restores in a single transaction that stops at first error; by default deletes nothing; `--clean` empties selected tables first (with `--ddl` uses `pg_restore --clean --if-exists`, with `--data` alone uses `TRUNCATE` without `CASCADE`); truncate commits before restore so the pair is not atomic.",
